The repos below are pulled live from GitHub — stars, description, and language update automatically. The list itself is just the names of your pinned repos; edit the pinnedRepos array below to match whatever you’ve pinned on your GitHub profile.

pinnedRepos = [
  "Olusegun-Python-Toolkit",
  "ascende-network",
   "nm-app"
  // add more repo names here, exactly as they appear in the GitHub URL
]







repos = Promise.all(
  pinnedRepos.map(name =&gt;
    fetch(`https://api.github.com/repos/chrystali2002/${name}`).then(r =&gt; r.json())
  )
)







html`${repos.map(r =&gt; `
  &lt;div class="card-block"&gt;
    &lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href="${r.html_url}" target="_blank"&gt;${r.name}&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;${r.description ?? "No description provided."}&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;span class="pill"&gt;${r.language ?? "—"}&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pill"&gt;★ ${r.stargazers_count}&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pill"&gt;Updated ${new Date(r.updated_at).toLocaleDateString()}&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
`).join("")}`






If this list doesn’t load (e.g. viewing offline), see the static project highlights instead.
